title: Jeena_Dialogue
---
<<met_player>>
Jeena: What do you want?
    -> I'm new to the area. Any tips?
        Jeena: There's a rough looking rat looking for any excuse to pat us down. Try and stay away!
    -> Interested in some cheese?
        // update trust 
        <<update_trust>>
        <<activate_selling>>
        Jeena: Ooh, let's see what you've got!
        <<set_node Jeena_Met>>
